WEBVTT

00:27:27.693 --> 00:27:31.559
that you can recall on this device
and play anytime you want.

00:27:31.583 --> 00:27:33.666
Participant 4: What's a recording?

00:27:33.690 --> 00:27:37.076
Participant 3: Well, anything
that you say out loud can be recorded.

00:27:37.100 --> 00:27:38.496
Think of it like an echo.

00:27:38.520 --> 00:27:40.676
AB: And so we realized all of a sudden,

00:27:40.700 --> 00:27:45.886
we had created a platform
to attend to them as human beings.

00:27:45.910 --> 00:27:48.326
And that became the secret.

00:27:48.350 --> 00:27:49.810
Don't tell anybody.

00:27:49.834 --> 00:27:51.126
(Both laugh)

00:27:51.150 --> 00:27:56.832
AB: That became the power
of the training that we were offering.

00:27:57.740 --> 00:27:59.661
AG: I was still skeptical.

00:27:59.685 --> 00:28:01.030
I needed a clear picture